@startuml
title Khách đặt đơn COD
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Customer
boundary WebApp
control API
control OrderService
entity PostgreSQL

Customer->WebApp: Chọn biến thể và nhập giao hàng
WebApp->API: POST /orders paymentMethod=cod
API->OrderService: Verify customer JWT
OrderService->PostgreSQL: BEGIN transaction
OrderService->PostgreSQL: Load active variants and voucher
PostgreSQL-->OrderService: Prices and voucher rules
OrderService->OrderService: Calculate subtotal discount total
OrderService->PostgreSQL: Reserve voucher through order state
OrderService->PostgreSQL: INSERT sales_order and order_details
OrderService->PostgreSQL: COMMIT transaction
PostgreSQL-->OrderService: Order pending unpaid
OrderService-->API: Order response
API-->WebApp: 201 order
WebApp-->Customer: Hiển thị đơn chờ xử lý
@enduml
